@startuml
title exact-orb — N8: расчёт успешен, Session Store недоступен при commit

autonumber
hide footbox

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2563EB
    LifeLineBorderColor #64748B
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantBorderColor #64748B
    ParticipantFontColor #0F172A
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
    ActorBorderColor #64748B
    ActorFontColor #0F172A
    ActorBackgroundColor #DBEAFE
    GroupBorderColor #94A3B8
    GroupHeaderFontColor #1E293B
    DividerBorderColor #94A3B8
    DividerFontColor #1E293B
    NoteBorderColor #94A3B8
    NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBEA
    NoteFontColor #334155
}

actor "Пользователь" as User

box "CLIENT / API" #DBEAFE
    boundary "Frontend" as FE
    boundary "FastAPI" as API
end box

box "APPLICATION" #FFEDD5
    control "Orchestrator" as Orch
    control "BuildNatalHandler" as Handler
    control "ProfileService" as Profile
end box

box "SESSION STATE" #D1FAE5
    control "ContextService" as Context
    database "Session Store" as Store
end box

box "CALCULATION" #FFF7CC
    control "ChartArtifactResolver" as Artifact
    database "Calculation Cache" as Cache
    control "CalculationEnginePort" as Engine
end box

User -> FE : Отправляет валидные данные
FE -> API : POST /charts/natal
API -> Orch : BuildNatalCommand

Orch -> Context : start_build(...)
Context -> Store : save BuildAttempt(PROCESSING)
Store --> Context : saved
Context --> Orch : build registered

Orch -> Handler : execute(run A)
Handler -> Artifact : ensure_natal(...)
Artifact -> Cache : get(calculation_key)
Cache --> Artifact : miss
Artifact -> Engine : calculate_natal(request)
Engine --> Artifact : valid ChartArtifact
Artifact -> Cache : put(calculation_key, ChartArtifact)
Artifact --> Handler : ChartArtifact

Handler -> Profile : prepare_base_delta(...)
Profile --> Handler : SessionProfileDelta
Handler --> Orch : BuildCompleted(A, delta)

Orch -> Context : commit_build_success(A, delta)
Context -> Store : atomic CAS profile + clear current_build
Store ->x Context : timeout / unavailable
Context --> Orch : STATE_PERSISTENCE_FAILED

Orch --> API : 503 STATE_PERSISTENCE_FAILED
API --> FE : retryable error
FE --> User : «Карта рассчитана, но состояние\nне удалось сохранить. Повторите»

note over Artifact, Cache
ChartArtifact остаётся корректным cache entry.
Но пользовательская операция не считается успешной,
пока SessionProfile не сохранён.
end note

note over Context, Store
FAILED может не сохраниться, если Store полностью недоступен.
Оставшийся PROCESSING позже признаётся INTERRUPTED
по run lease / timeout.
end note

== Retry после восстановления Session Store ==

User -> FE : Нажимает «Повторить»
FE -> API : RetryBuildCommand\n[new revision after interrupted lease]
API -> Orch : retry command
Orch -> Context : register new BuildAttempt
Context -> Store : save PROCESSING
Store --> Context : saved
Context --> Orch : registered

Orch -> Handler : execute(retry)
Handler -> Artifact : ensure_natal(same inputs/spec)
Artifact -> Cache : get(same calculation_key)
Cache --> Artifact : HIT ChartArtifact
Artifact --> Handler : ChartArtifact
Handler -> Profile : prepare_base_delta(...)
Profile --> Handler : SessionProfileDelta
Handler --> Orch : BuildCompleted(retry, delta)

Orch -> Context : commit_build_success(retry, delta)
Context -> Store : atomic CAS
Store --> Context : committed
Context --> Orch : success
Orch --> API : BuildResult
API --> FE : 200 Chart DTO
FE --> User : Показывает карту

note over Artifact, Engine
При retry Engine повторно не вызывается.
end note

@enduml
